#: weather/package/contents/ui/configLocation.qml:127
msgid ""
"The data is MET Norway's, under CC BY 4.0;\n"
"its terms ask for the attribution line."
msgstr ""
"Die Daten stammen von MET Norway, unter CC BY 4.0;\n"
"die Lizenzbedingungen verlangen die Quellenzeile."

#: weather/package/contents/ui/configLocation.qml:129
msgid ""
"The data is WeatherAPI.com's; the free plan gives three forecast days\n"
"and asks for the attribution line."
msgstr ""
"Die Daten stammen von WeatherAPI.com; der kostenlose Tarif bietet drei "
"Vorhersagetage\n"
"und verlangt die Quellenzeile."

#: weather/package/contents/ui/configLocation.qml:131
msgid ""
"The data is Visual Crossing's; the free plan is a thousand records a day,\n"
"one per forecast day, and its terms ask for the attribution line."
msgstr ""
"Die Daten stammen von Visual Crossing; der kostenlose Tarif umfasst tausend "
"Datensätze am Tag,\n"
"einen je Vorhersagetag, und die Nutzungsbedingungen verlangen die "
"Quellenzeile."

#: weather/package/contents/ui/configLocation.qml:133
msgid ""
"The data is Open-Meteo's, free for non-commercial use;\n"
"its terms ask for the attribution line."
msgstr ""
"Die Daten stammen von Open-Meteo, kostenlos für nicht-kommerzielle Nutzung;\n"
"die Nutzungsbedingungen verlangen die Quellenzeile."

